  "story": "Two trains wait on side tracks, each already sorted by car number, lowest first; numbers may repeat. Couple them into one train that is sorted the same way. No car may be copied or rebuilt: only change which car follows which. Return the front car of the joined train, or NOTHING if both tracks are empty. Either track may be empty, and the lowest car may stand on either track.",
