  "hints": ["Look only at the front car of each waiting train: the lower of the two is the next car of the joined train.", "Remember the last car you coupled. Take the lower front car, use SET NEXT to couple it behind the last car, make it the new last car, and move its train on with NEXT NODE. The very first car you take is the front of the joined train.", "Stop when one train IS NOTHING and couple whatever is left of the other behind the last car in one move. IF no car was ever coupled, one track was empty from the start: RETURN the other train."],
